    kanal\u0131 (ductus nasolacrimalis) ile kom\u015Fudur.Ders kitab\u0131na g\xF6re
    Os lacrimale, y\xFCz kemiklerinin en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk ve en ince olan\u0131d\u0131r.
    Orbita\u2019n\u0131n i\xE7 yan duvar\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n k\u0131sm\u0131nda yer
